  _subtitle: Bound to the Golden Cap
  _description: He and his band must obey whoever owns the [[a2be94e7-27ba-428e-ad51-fe4d358d3d40|Golden
    Cap]], three times each. They serve the [[435afc3a-0611-401c-8267-920193da9c7f|Wicked
    Witch of the West]] until [[397fd117-a8f8-4702-a3f6-36373425de00|Dorothy Gale]]
    wins the Cap.
